WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
On screen: Stop paying for days you don't chat.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The model picker opens on providers like Anthropic, Google and OpenAI, then switches to the OpenRouter gateway.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The same chat app on a desktop and a phone. A push notification says the response is ready.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The desktop and phone screens switch from the light theme to the dark theme.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Web search is set to Brave from the tools menu, then the price list per 1,000 searches: Brave $5, Exa Auto $7.

6
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.000
A right-click on an answer shows its model, provider, tokens and cost, including the Brave search.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.500
A sunset illustration generated by Nano Banana 2, right in the chat.

8
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.000
Add from library in the tools menu opens the file manager, which lists uploads and AI-generated files with storage used.

9
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
A project page with shared instructions, then its knowledge files and the memory entries kept for the project's chats.

10
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.500
An answer with highlighted TypeScript code, then a rendered sequence diagram of the request path.

11
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.500
Reasoning steps expand, and reasoning effort is set to Medium from the tools menu.

12
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.500
Gemini Deep Research shows each search and source it used, then the report.

13
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.000
Besidka. Open source. No subscription. Pay providers directly. besidka.com
